!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Charity Connection Service</title>
<style>
body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #fff8dc, #ffffff); }
header { text-align: center; padding: 20px; }
header img { width: 100%; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
section { padding: 20px; max-width: 900px; margin: auto; }
.card { background: white; padding: 20px; margin: 15px 0; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; background: #333; color: white; margin-top: 40px; }
button { background: #4CAF50; border: none; padding: 10px 20px; color: white; border-radius: 5px; cursor: pointer; }
button:hover { background: #45a049; }
.banner-caption { position: relative; top: -150px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); display: inline-block; padding: 15px 25px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold; color: #4CAF50; }


/* Headings style */
h1 { font-size: 2.5em; color: #2E8B57; }
h2 { font-size: 1.8em; color: #FF8C00; margin-bottom: 10px; }
p { font-size: 1em; color: #333; }


/* Donation images */
.donation-images { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 15px; justify-content: center; }
.donation-images img { width: 220px; height: 150px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
.donation-item { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 15px; }
.donation-item h3 { margin: 10px 0; color: #2E8B57; }
@media(max-width: 768px){ .donation-images img { width: 100%; height: auto; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<img src="https://i.postimg.cc/WdJyQxf5/66c7455c.jpg" alt="Helping Hands Banner" />
<div class="banner-caption">Helping Hands: Connecting Donors with Those in Need</div>
<h1>Charity Connection Service</h1>
<p>Connecting donors with people in need</p>
</header>


<section>
<div class="card">
<h2>About Us</h2>
<p>Because your unused items can change someone’s life.</p>
</div>


<div class="card">
<h2>Donate an Item</h2>
<p>Give what you don’t need. Change what someone can’t live without.</p>
<button>Submit Donation</button>
<div class="donation-images">
<div class="donation-item">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1606851099685-108621b62f5c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Clothes Donation" />
<h3>Clothes</h3>
</div>
<div class="donation-item">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591012911206-6d1f7d936254?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Toys Donation" />
<h3>Toys</h3>
</div>
<div class="donation-item">
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524995997946-a1c2e315a42f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Books Donation" />
<h3>Books</h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>


<div class="card">
<h2>Request an Item</h2>
<p>If you need it, we’re here to help connect you with support.</p>
<button>Request Item</button>
</div>
</section>


<footer>
<h2>Mission</h2>
<p>Together, we build a community of giving.</p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
